WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.745
Let's build a Mystery Gift in the Fieldnote demo
store. Spend fifty dollars and receive one free gift,

2
00:00:06.745 --> 00:00:08.244
displayed as Mystery Notebook.

3
00:00:08.594 --> 00:00:15.676
Cart and checkout presentation requires a Shopify Plus
store, the MTD Plus plan, granted checkout permissions

4
00:00:15.676 --> 00:00:20.988
and a supported gift campaign. Storefront cart only is
a separate option.

5
00:00:21.338 --> 00:00:28.291
We will use an unpublished theme copy and a temporary
campaign, leaving the existing demo setup unchanged.

6
00:00:29.341 --> 00:00:35.737
Create a new Gift offer, give it a descriptive name
and keep it automatic. In Conditions, choose Cart

7
00:00:35.737 --> 00:00:36.093
value.

8
00:00:36.443 --> 00:00:42.682
In Rewards, set the minimum to fifty U.S. dollars and
the gift discount to one hundred percent.

9
00:00:43.032 --> 00:00:50.202
Select the exact Cobalt and Sun variants for the gift
pool. Checkout mystery needs explicit variants, not

10
00:00:50.202 --> 00:00:54.841
just a whole-product selection. Only one eligible gift
will be delivered.

11
00:00:55.191 --> 00:01:01.913
Our temporary Gift Notebook has three editions. Tick
Cobalt and Sun individually, and leave Coral

12
00:01:01.913 --> 00:01:08.187
unselected. The product's parent checkbox selects the
whole product, not this exact variant pool.

13
00:01:09.237 --> 00:01:15.757
Open Gift delivery and choose Random one from selected
gifts. Keep a fixed quantity of one. Automatic

14
00:01:15.757 --> 00:01:18.059
addition is enabled for this mode.

15
00:01:18.409 --> 00:01:24.838
In Advanced gift settings, turn on Keep the selected
gift a mystery. Enter Mystery Notebook and choose

16
00:01:24.838 --> 00:01:26.351
Storefront cart and checkout.

17
00:01:26.701 --> 00:01:33.628
For this walkthrough, keep the original product image.
The product title is neutral, but the image and

18
00:01:33.628 --> 00:01:39.740
variant label can still identify the selection. A
neutral image is a separate presentation choice.

19
00:01:40.090 --> 00:01:46.423
If checkout is locked, check the displayed plan,
permissions and campaign requirements. Do not remove

20
00:01:46.423 --> 00:01:50.222
safeguards or change unrelated settings to force it
on.

21
00:01:51.272 --> 00:01:58.597
Review the fifty-dollar threshold, one hundred percent
reward, exact variant pool and fixed gift quantity.

22
00:01:58.597 --> 00:02:04.456
Keep extra targeting, limits and discount combinations
unchanged for this isolated example.

23
00:02:04.806 --> 00:02:11.839
Save the campaign as an inactive draft. Reopen it and
confirm the title, checkout surface and pool were

24
00:02:11.839 --> 00:02:13.402
saved before activating it.

25
00:02:13.752 --> 00:02:20.838
Different currencies, countries and discount codes
need their own tests. This U.S. dollar demonstration

26
00:02:20.838 --> 00:02:23.874
does not certify every checkout configuration.

27
00:02:24.924 --> 00:02:31.922
Make sure Gift Auto-Add is enabled and saved in the
theme you are previewing. This is an app embed,

28
00:02:31.922 --> 00:02:35.973
separate from the discount widgets. Then activate only
this test campaign.

29
00:02:36.323 --> 00:02:42.439
Start with an empty cart. Two Coral notebooks cost
forty-eight dollars, so no mystery gift should be

30
00:02:42.439 --> 00:02:42.799
added.

31
00:02:43.149 --> 00:02:49.145
Increase Coral to three. The paid purchase is now
seventy-two dollars. One Mystery Notebook should

32
00:02:49.145 --> 00:02:55.542
appear free before you press checkout. Wait for the
actual gift result before checking its price.

33
00:02:56.592 --> 00:03:04.416
Open the real checkout. Confirm three Coral notebooks
and exactly one free Mystery Notebook. The merchandise

34
00:03:04.416 --> 00:03:06.372
amount remains seventy-two dollars.

35
00:03:06.722 --> 00:03:13.789
Mystery presentation changes the shopper-facing title,
not the original product variant or SKU used for

36
00:03:13.789 --> 00:03:17.558
fulfillment. It does not create a replacement product.

37
00:03:17.908 --> 00:03:24.942
Check quantities and the free price, not only the
title. Stop if the gift is charged or a warning blocks

38
00:03:24.942 --> 00:03:29.162
checkout. We enter no customer or payment details and
place no order.

39
00:03:30.212 --> 00:03:36.673
Return to the cart and manually remove Mystery
Notebook. It should stay removed for the unchanged

40
00:03:36.673 --> 00:03:39.096
paid purchase, including after a refresh.

41
00:03:39.446 --> 00:03:46.533
Change the paid quantity from three Coral notebooks to
four. This new qualifying purchase can receive one

42
00:03:46.533 --> 00:03:48.617
gift again, without duplicate gifts.

43
00:03:48.967 --> 00:03:55.034
Remove the paid purchase and confirm the gift is
cleaned up. Repeat the qualifying add and removal

44
00:03:55.034 --> 00:03:57.532
check, then finish with an empty cart.

45
00:03:57.882 --> 00:04:04.638
After filming, we remove only our temporary campaign,
theme and checkout test resources. Existing campaigns

46
00:04:04.638 --> 00:04:11.844
remain unchanged. Keep your own launch inactive until
your intended markets and codes pass their checks.
